<title>SINGAPORE: IPCO 1996 net profit down 13 pct.</title>
<headline>IPCO 1996 net profit down 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 6.74  vs    7.75</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)  17.00  vs   19.50</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 6.00  vs    5.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		 275.65  vs  258.27</p>
<p>    Other income	     0.94  vs    0.99</p>
<p>    Operating profit	20.01  vs   13.40</p>
<p>    Associates		(0.91) vs    3.27</p>
<p>    Pretax		    19.10  vs   16.67</p>
<p>    Tax			  2.60  vs    4.22</p>
<p>    Minorities		(9.76) vs   (4.70)</p>
<p>Note - IPCO International Ltd is an infrastructure development company.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
